Verse 1
My [F]Jesus, I [Bb]love thee, I [F]know thou art [C]mine;
for [F]thee all the [Bb]follies of [F]sin I re[C]sign.
My [F]gracious Re[Bb]deemer, my [F]Savior art [C]thou:
if [F]ever I [Bb]loved thee, my [F]Jesus, 'tis [C]now.
